{"3779120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sub-Species", "steam_appid": 3779120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Species is a 2.5D Arcade Action/Adventure, where you control a submarine that rotates 360° in order to battle alien sea monsters that will be coming at you from all angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore the contaminated zones,  outmanoeuvring and fighting aggressive alien lifeforms that have overrun these areas of the ocean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 12 levels in 4 environments, as you search for new weapons and lost experimental technology amongst the shipwrecks and naval outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Story unfolds, uncover the secrets of the emerging alien world, and the naval authorities that control it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sub-Species is a 2.5D Arcade Action/Adventure, where you control a submarine that rotates 360° in order to battle alien sea monsters that will be coming at you from all angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore the contaminated zones,  outmanoeuvring and fighting aggressive alien lifeforms that have overrun these areas of the ocean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/38ebd1722d554eb70f2d9c5af3a1e405.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across 12 levels in 4 environments, as you search for new weapons and lost experimental technology amongst the shipwrecks and naval outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/c655f8ed647fbfbce827add06a79cc7f.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Story unfolds, uncover the secrets of the emerging alien world, and the naval authorities that control it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.poster.avif?t=1784034362\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.webm?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/extras/3727f5854376e5346ecc4d5464a74f83.mp4?t=1784034362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "At first the alien outbreak spreading throughout the oceans was confined. We delayed our extinction rather than avert it. As part of a salvage crew, you search the hellish containment zones, where a treasure trove of lost tech can help you and your crew eke out a living in a slowly dying world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The hook that jumps out right away is how Sub-Species blends the atmospheric tension of Subnautica with the aggressive arcade energy of Space Invaders.”<br>Comicbook<br><br>“There is something inherently unsettling about the ocean… that specific brand of thalassophobia was solidified by Subnautica.”<br>Total Apex Gaming<br><br>“The trailer, which you can watch below, definitely has our attention. We’re big Ecco the Dolphin fans and while Ecco’s arsenal was limited to headbutts and sonar attacks, we’re always on the lookout for opportunities to explore virtual oceans, the deeper the better”<br>Gamespew<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/23c7e44918d8f983154574363f16dd576bd3f3e2/header.jpg?t=1784034362", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/d6b567ab9e720f484fe7e23c216ac798121d11fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784034362", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779120/d6b567ab9e720f484fe7e23c216ac798121d11fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784034362", "website": "https://Sub-Species.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Howling Hamster Entertainment"], "publishers": ["Howling Hamster Entertainment"], "demos": [{"appid": 4160530, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}